DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45475::$$$message_0427_0000_0000$$$::"Tokiomi...Tohsaka! I'll kill you! And then I'll take Rin to Bring Your Parent to School Day!"::
45476::$$$message_0427_0000_0001$$$::"Another troublesome one... Are you also after the onsen?"::
45477::$$$message_0427_0000_0002$$$::"Of course. I'll never let you be the one to take Aoi and Sakura on a family onsen trip!"::
45478::$$$message_0427_0000_0003$$$::"Enough, Kariya Matou. The very sight of you is enough to damage my beard cuticles."::
45479::$$$message_0427_0000_0004$$$::"If you let us pass, I'll send you some of Aoi's home cooking in the future. Just the leftovers that would have gone in the garbage, though."::
45480::$$$message_0427_0000_0005$$$::"Y-you're the one man I can never forgive... You won't finish Aoi's cooking, and you'll even throw it away!?"::
45481::$$$message_0427_0000_0006$$$::"Kirei. What do you think of this mongrel's howling?"::
45482::$$$message_0427_0000_0007$$$::"It is...[wvl canskip=false time=100]delectable. I could even have it with three helpings of mapo tofu."::
45483::$$$message_0427_0000_0008$$$::"Huh? Are you awakening some new fetish?"::
45484::$$$message_0427_0000_0009$$$::"I no longer care for the onsen or Master Tokiomi."::
45485::$$$message_0427_0000_0010$$$::"Right now, I feel like teasing that painfully pathetic man might be the greatest delight of all."::
45486::$$$message_0427_0000_0011$$$::"Heh. Finally, you've discovered the meaning of pleasure. [wvl][hfwww layer=0] But it seems you've already reached your limits. Maybe I'll only use your last name going forward."::
45487::$$$message_0427_0000_0012$$$::"That's right, Master. I want to torment that man and have a nice glass of wine. May I?"::
45488::$$$message_0427_0000_0013$$$::"Um, I've been saying we shouldn't bother with him..."::
45489::$$$message_0427_0000_0014$$$::"Kill him, Berserker! Kill Tohsaka's Servant!!!"::
45490::$$$message_0427_0000_0015$$$::"[wacky len=9]!!!"::

